WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.416 --> 00:00:12.456
A waterslide!

2
00:00:12.937 --> 00:00:14.317
They are so much fun.

3
00:00:14.337 --> 00:00:16.738
Brad: You’re both crazy.

4
00:00:17.459 --> 00:00:18.959
You don’t know where it leads.

5
00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:22.381
Danny: It has to lead somewhere.

6
00:00:22.981 --> 00:00:24.162
I think we should try it.

7
00:00:24.182 --> 00:00:26.003
Tina: I’ll go first!

8
00:00:26.323 --> 00:00:28.964
Ready? Start right after me, Brad!

9
00:00:32.752 --> 00:00:34.193
Danny: You better go, Brad.

10
00:00:34.854 --> 00:00:36.155
We don’t want to lose her.

11
00:00:36.175 --> 00:00:38.917
Danny: One, two, three!

12
00:00:38.937 --> 00:00:41.239
I’m right behind you!

13
00:00:41.259 --> 00:00:47.844
Tina: Wheee!

14
00:00:47.984 --> 00:00:49.325
This is incredible!

15
00:00:49.345 --> 00:00:51.947
Brad: I think I’m going to be sick.

16
00:00:53.369 --> 00:00:55.730
Danny: This is more fun than being in class!

17
00:00:57.732 --> 00:00:58.993
Brad: Whoo-hoo!

18
00:00:59.013 --> 00:01:01.675
Danny: That’s the spirit, Brad.

19
00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:07.582
Tina: It’s about time we had fun!

20
00:01:07.602 --> 00:01:12.106
Danny: Which way do we go?

21
00:01:12.126 --> 00:01:14.228
Tina: I don’t know!

22
00:01:14.248 --> 00:01:16.390
Brad, what do you think?

23
00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:18.491
Brad: How should I know?!

24
00:01:18.511 --> 00:01:21.914
Danny: Somebody decide quickly!

25
00:01:21.934 --> 00:01:24.897
Tina: This way!

26
00:01:24.917 --> 00:01:29.241
Brad: What if we went the wrong way?

27
00:01:29.261 --> 00:01:32.364
Tina: Then this won’t be much fun anymore.

28
00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:36.281
Danny: We haven’t done too badly, so far.

29
00:01:36.301 --> 00:01:38.422
Brad: Oh yeah?

30
00:01:38.782 --> 00:01:40.283
Well, just look ahead.

31
00:01:44.444 --> 00:01:44.945
three: Aaah!

32
00:01:44.965 --> 00:01:48.166
Tina: Danny this isn’t good.

33
00:01:48.186 --> 00:01:49.567
Brad: Yeah.

34
00:01:49.867 --> 00:01:52.848
Now would be a good time to use your imagination again.

35
00:01:52.868 --> 00:01:55.609
Danny: I’ve got an idea!

36
00:01:56.970 --> 00:01:57.830
Hold on to me!

37
00:01:57.850 --> 00:01:59.311
Brad: What?

38
00:02:00.251 --> 00:02:01.371
Danny: You and Tina.

39
00:02:01.812 --> 00:02:02.552
Hold on to me!

40
00:02:03.436 --> 00:02:04.577
Tina: This better work!

41
00:02:04.617 --> 00:02:07.438
Brad: Oh no!

42
00:02:07.459 --> 00:02:10.000
Tina: Danny, do something!

43
00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:15.023
Danny: Both of you, start blowing.

44
00:02:20.647 --> 00:02:22.728
Tina: You’re a genius, Danny!

45
00:02:22.748 --> 00:02:25.410
Brad: Hey, I’m the smart one.

46
00:02:26.690 --> 00:02:28.812
Danny: More blowing, less talking!

47
00:02:36.236 --> 00:02:38.977
Danny: That’s it, I think we’ve stopped falling.

48
00:02:38.997 --> 00:02:47.221
Brad: I can’t blow anymore!

49
00:02:47.241 --> 00:02:53.563
Tina: I’m out of breath too!

50
00:02:53.583 --> 00:02:57.045
Danny: Don’t stop now, you guys!

51
00:02:57.065 --> 00:03:00.406
Tina: Everybody blow!

52
00:03:00.426 --> 00:03:02.287
Danny: Hurry!

53
00:03:05.730 --> 00:03:06.440
Brad: Oh no!
